@host = http://localhost:5035

### Hent kaffemeny
GET {{host}}/menu
Accept: application/json

### Hent spesifikk ordre
GET {{host}}/orders/b58ed29a-e898-4fc2-b0ba-89c9bcf80668
Accept: application/json

### Oppdater status på ordre (`PENDING` → `BREWING` → `READY`)
PATCH {{host}}/orders/b58ed29a-e898-4fc2-b0ba-89c9bcf80668
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "status": "BREWING"
}

### Opprett en ny bestilling – gyldig
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "coffeeId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "size": "MEDIUM",
  "milkType": "OAT",
  "customerName": "Herman",
  "quantity": 2,
  "extraShot": true
}

### Ugyldig – blankt CustomerName og Quantity utenfor range -> 400 ValidationProblemDetails
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "coffeeId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "size": "MEDIUM",
  "milkType": "OAT",
  "customerName": "Herman",
  "quantity": 42
}

### Ugyldig – CustomerName mangler helt -> 400
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "coffeeId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "size": "MEDIUM",
  "milkType": "OAT"
}

### Se den genererte OpenAPI-spesifikasjonen (åpne i browser)
{{host}}/openapi/v1.json

### Åpne Scalar UI (åpne i browser)
{{host}}/scalar/v1